    "title": "Overview of 'The Studio' Series",
    "text": "• Seth Rogen stars as Matt Remick, the head of the fictional Continental Studios.\n• The series 'The Studio' is a 10-episode show debuting on Apple TV+.\n• Rogen's character faces challenges in the film industry, including pressure to produce commercially viable content.\n• The show reflects contemporary Hollywood, contrasting with earlier films that depicted the industry in a more glamorous light.\n• Rogen and his collaborator, Goldberg, emphasize that the show is not a postmortem of Hollywood but rather a perspective of optimism amidst challenges.\n• The film industry is experiencing a decline in ticket sales, with a reported 6.9% decrease from the previous year and 38.6% from 2019, according to Comscore.\n• The industry is increasingly focused on intellectual property (IP) and franchises due to audience distractions from streaming and video games.",
